&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://emoji.slack-edge.com/T8GS4RNNM/bias-for-action/0a5bd6888d3f2db1.gif&quot; alt=&quot;:bias-for-action:&quot; width=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for action&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our world moves quickly and so do we. We take calculated risks and we deliver impact fast.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
